'''Molten '''is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by [[Crafting/Salvaging|crafting]] it or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is made up of a dark-orangish yellow molten texture, hence the name. The guard is orange, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Molten (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
* Players can exchange 12 uncommon [[shards]] through [[crafting]] to obtain it by chance.
* When salvaged, it grants 2 rare shards.

